<scb-header title="微信订阅提醒" disabled="{{busy}}"/>
<view class="page fig-page ui002-workspace">
 <view class="fig-summary light notification-summary"><view class="notification-summary-icon"><image src="/assets/figma/bell.svg" mode="aspectFit" aria-hidden="true"/></view><view class="fig-summary-copy"><view class="fig-kicker">本人微信身份</view><view class="fig-summary-title">本次提醒选择</view><view class="fig-summary-sub">每次订阅由本人明确选择并确认。</view></view></view>
 <view class="notification-tabs"><view class="selected">提醒设置</view><view>最近记录</view></view>
 <view wx:if="{{loginRequired}}" class="card"><view>登录并绑定当前小程序微信身份后，可逐次选择提醒。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="login">登录并继续</button></view>
 <view class="notice">关注赛事不代表已授权订阅。每次由本人在微信弹窗选择，一次许可只安排一次提醒；微信受理不代表已经送达。</view>
 <view wx:if="{{!enabled}}" class="notice warning">正式微信模板或通道尚未配置。当前可查看站内消息，不会发送微信提醒。</view>
 <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice warning">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{message}}" class="notice">{{message}}</view>
 <view class="card notification-choices"><view class="subtitle">选择本次提醒</view>
  <button wx:for="{{kinds}}" wx:key="kind" class="notification-choice {{selected === item.kind ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-kind="{{item.kind}}" bindtap="choose" disabled="{{busy || pending || !item.templateId}}"><view class="choice-mark"><scb-icon wx:if="{{selected === item.kind}}" name="check" tone="white" size="12"/></view><view class="choice-copy"><view class="fig-row-title">{{item.label}}</view><view class="small muted">由本人决定是否取得本次许可</view></view><view class="fig-pill">{{selected === item.kind ? '已选择' : '未选择'}}</view></button>
  <button class="primary" bindtap="prepare" disabled="{{busy || pending || !enabled}}">准备本次订阅</button>
  <button wx:if="{{intent}}" class="primary" bindtap="subscribe" disabled="{{busy || pending}}">打开微信弹窗，决定本次订阅</button>
 </view>
 <view class="card notification-flow"><view class="fig-card-title">订阅流程</view><view class="notification-step"><text>1</text><view><view class="fig-row-title">绑定当前微信身份</view><view class="small muted">先核验登录账号</view></view></view><view class="notification-step"><text>2</text><view><view class="fig-row-title">准备所选提醒</view><view class="small muted">按模板与用途读取能力</view></view></view><view class="notification-step"><text>3</text><view><view class="fig-row-title">微信弹窗确认</view><view class="small muted">以本次授权结果为准</view></view></view></view>
 <view wx:if="{{pending}}" class="card"><view class="subtitle">原请求待核对</view><view>核对原请求后继续，避免重复申请。身份验证信息不会保存到本机恢复记录。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="recover" disabled="{{busy}}">核对原请求</button></view>
 <button class="secondary" bindtap="revoke" disabled="{{busy}}">明确撤销本类许可及待发提醒</button>
 <view class="card notification-records"><view class="subtitle">渠道状态与最近记录</view><view class="notification-record" wx:for="{{subscriptions}}" wx:key="id"><view>{{item.label}}</view><view class="fig-pill">{{item.stateLabel}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!subscriptions.length}}" class="muted">暂无订阅许可记录</view><view class="notification-record"><view><view class="fig-row-title">站内消息</view><view class="small muted">可直接查看本人消息</view></view><view class="fig-pill available">可用</view></view></view>
 <button class="secondary" bindtap="messages">查看站内消息</button>
</view>
<view class="fig-actions dock"><button class="fig-ghost" bindtap="recover" disabled="{{busy || !pending}}">核对原请求</button><button class="fig-confirm" bindtap="messages">查看站内消息</button></view>
